{"type":"message","message":{"id":"msg_2da5a075-4066-40da-a7d1-8f9e8141ddb9","role":"user","created":1775333515,"content":[{"type":"toolResponse","id":"call_9f73cde51fb743bf800c8443","toolResult":{"status":"success","value":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"354:Offsetting receipts are generally deducted from budget authority and outlays by function, subfunction, or agency. There are four types of receipts, however, that are deducted from budget totals as undistributed offsetting receipts. They are: (1) agencies' payments (including payments by off-budget Federal entities) as employers into employees' retirement funds; (2) interest received by trust funds; (3) rents and royalties on the Outer Continental Shelf lands; and (4) other interest (i.e., that collected on Outer Continental Shelf money in deposit funds when such money is transferred into the budget).\n736:| Fiscal year or month | National Aeronautics and Space Administration (25) | National Science Foundation (26) | Office of Personnel Management (27) | Small Business Administration (28) | Social Security Administration (29) | Independent agencies (30) | Employer share, employee retirement (31) | Interest received by trust funds (32) | Rents and royalties on the Outer Continental Shelf (33) | Other (34) | Total outlays On-budget (35) | Total outlays Off-budget (36) |","annotations":{"priority":0.0}}],"structuredContent":{"stdout":"354:Offsetting receipts are generally deducted from budget authority and outlays by function, subfunction, or agency. There are four types of receipts, however, that are deducted from budget totals as undistributed offsetting receipts. They are: (1) agencies' payments (including payments by off-budget Federal entities) as employers into employees' retirement funds; (2) interest received by trust funds; (3) rents and royalties on the Outer Continental Shelf lands; and (4) other interest (i.e., that collected on Outer Continental Shelf money in deposit funds when such money is transferred into the budget).\n736:| Fiscal year or month | National Aeronautics and Space Administration (25) | National Science Foundation (26) | Office of Personnel Management (27) | Small Business Administration (28) | Social Security Administration (29) | Independent agencies (30) | Employer share, employee retirement (31) | Interest received by trust funds (32) | Rents and royalties on the Outer Continental Shelf (33) | Other (34) | Total outlays On-budget (35) | Total outlays Off-budget (36) |","stderr":"","exit_code":0},"isError":false}}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
